sub("4. `keep(ticket)`: writes nothing; adds `worst` to `scope.kept` (the run's own cost record includes it, 5.5).","4. `keep(ticket, ctx)`: writes nothing to the store; adds `ticket.worst` to `ctx.booked` and to `scope.kept` (the run's own cost record includes it, 5.5). `release(ticket, ctx)`: `reserver.release(ticket)` runs `add_spend(agent, ticket.day, -worst)`; if that fails it behaves as a failed give-back (the amount stays booked, so `keep(ticket, ctx)` is applied, logged and audited). Both never raise.")
