sub("An outage or a wrong key fills the daily limit faster; that is a loud stop (5.5). Releasing a definite client error (400, 401, 403, 404, 422) is L-6 (invoice evidence).","A wrong key (401) or a malformed request (400) books nothing, so it cannot empty the day (v10: four calls). A 429 storm or a 5xx outage keeps the worst case of each attempt, but one call keeps at most `max_call` in all (admit step (e)). Releasing 408, 429, 5xx and timeouts is L-6 (needs invoice evidence).")
